sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant Fleet as Monad Fleet service
    participant Event as /event/{id}
    participant DB

    Device->>Fleet: PublishEvent(COMMAND_FINISHED/ERROR/ARTIFACT_UPLOADED)
    Fleet->>Event: GET /event/{id}
    Event-->>Fleet: current metadata
    Fleet->>Event: PATCH metadata (events[], last_event, summary, status)
    Event->>DB: UPDATE metadata JSON
    DB-->>Event: OK
    Event-->>Fleet: 200 + updated event
    Fleet-->>Device: Ack(ok=true)

    opt terminal state
        Fleet->>Event: set completed_at
    end
